# ---- NOT direct members; left unmapped ON PURPOSE, with the reason, so nobody re-guesses ---------
# kSkaterMesh        0x280  the mesh is not at 0x280 in this PDB's ASkaterCharacterBase -- the value
#                           is right (the mod uses it) but what names it is not yet established.
# kBoardIface        0x280  an interface sub-object, not a reflected member.
# kBoardMoveMode     0x188  reached as iface+0x50 via +0x138, NOT a member of the movement component:
#                           _onEndBanking happens to sit at 0x188 and would agree for the wrong reason.
# kSkaterToggleState 0xa38  derived in ApplyToggleOnBoard rather than read as a named field.
# kSkaterReplayAttachA 0xa68 the anim-rate bitfield byte, not a named member.

