# LEFT UNMAPPED ON PURPOSE -- the offset is right, the obvious class is not:
#   ACTOR_CURLOD / ACTOR_CURNORM / ACTOR_LODDATA / ACTOR_SKINNORM / ACTOR_STRIDE
#       named for the skin-cache/render-data structures they index, not for AActor. Prefix-matching
#       lands them on ReplicatedMovement, Tags and RootComponent, which share the offsets and mean
#       nothing like the same thing.
#   SM_HASCLOTH
#       shares an offset with USkeletalMesh::bHasVertexColors. Different flag, same byte.
